{%- comment -%}
  JATAYU Luxury Fashion — Our Story Section
  Editorial storytelling, Ramayana heritage, contemporary fashion synthesis
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="story-page-section" style="padding: clamp(60px, 8vw, 120px) 0; margin-top: var(--header-height);">
  <div class="page-width">
    <!-- Story Hero -->
    <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 64px;">
      <span class="label-eyebrow">OUR ORIGIN & ETHOS</span>
      <h1 class="display-large" style="color: var(--color-maroon-primary); margin-bottom: 24px;">
        A Legacy of Courage.
      </h1>
      <p class="body-lead" style="margin: 0 auto; font-size: 1.3rem;">
        "Inspired by Jatayu's unwavering valor in the Ramayana, JATAYU bridges sacred Indian heritage with international contemporary fashion."
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Layout -->
    <div class="brand-story-grid" style="margin-bottom: 80px;">
      <div class="brand-story-media">
        <img src="{{ 'story-heritage.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="JATAYU Sacred Heritage" class="brand-story-img" width="600" height="700">
      </div>
      <div class="brand-story-content">
        <span class="label-eyebrow">THE INSPIRATION</span>
        <h2 class="heading-section" style="color: var(--color-maroon-primary);">The Spirit of the Golden Eagle</h2>
        <div class="brand-story-text">
          <p>
            In the ancient epic of the Ramayana, when Maa Sita was abducted, it was Jatayu—the divine eagle—who witnessed injustice and rose into the sky without hesitation. Though outmatched, he fought with fearless courage and laid down his life in noble duty.
          </p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">
            At JATAYU, we honor that timeless spirit not as distant mythology, but as living principle. Courage is not the absence of fear, but the conviction to rise when summoned.
          </p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">
            Our garments are crafted to be worn with purpose—an armor of quiet strength, pride in cultural roots, and effortless modern elegance.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Second Story Section -->
    <div style="background-color: var(--color-ivory-parchment); padding: clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px); text-align: center; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border-sand); margin-top: 40px;">
      <span class="label-eyebrow">CONTEMPORARY LUXURY</span>
      <h3 class="heading-section" style="color: var(--color-maroon-primary); margin-bottom: 16px;">
        Modern Silhouettes. Enduring Quality.
      </h3>
      <p style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 32px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(33, 27, 25, 0.85);">
        Every piece begins with heavyweight, durable cotton weaves engineered for exceptional drape, comfort, and longevity. Designed for those who honor where they come from while shaping where they are going.
      </p>
      <a href="/collections/all" class="btn btn-primary">Explore The Collection</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Our Story Content",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
